&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer with a &lt;strong&gt;minimum of 15 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll work on our in-house package, &#39;Miles,&#39; an ERP software for automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. This end-to-end solution encompasses front, mid, and back-office functions that can be extensively customized to the customers’ needs through configuration and custom development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of a multidisciplinary team that includes other developers, business consultants, and testers, covering our end-to-end business flow. You can rely on a broad base of knowledge and expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every team in Sofico works in an agile way, including scrum, daily stand-ups, and backlog refinement. Additionally, you’ll be joining our Java community, which connects all the Software Engineers within Sofico worldwide to share best practices, code, tips, and tricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Right Fit for the Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for developing and building solutions is at the top of our list. As a Software Engineer, it is also key to keep the bigger picture in mind and understand how different elements are intertwined. Problem-solving is one of your strongest abilities, and you approach it methodically. If you are a team player who &lt;strong&gt;enjoys collaborating &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;sharing knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;, you’re the perfect blend of technical and soft skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position, based in &lt;strong&gt;Sydney&lt;/strong&gt;, offers a hybrid work model: three days in-office and two days remote.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Candidates must possess full working rights in Australia; sponsorship is not available.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your application, elaborate on the following aspects of your career:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience spanning over &lt;strong&gt;15 years&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise as either a Full Stack Developer or specialized in Back End development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Java 17, Java EE 7, SQL/JPA, Hibernate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Agile&lt;/strong&gt; Methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;Automotive, Finance, or Leasing&lt;/strong&gt; industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;Monolithic &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt; architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significance in constructing and deploying solutions, both internally and for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engagement in enhancing current applications, developing new modules, or executing customization projects for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstration of adeptly &lt;strong&gt;resolving complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; in a systematic manner, with project-specific details provided in your application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including client interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, given our international and multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About Us&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover how Sofico empowers businesses in 27 countries worldwide. With offices in Australia, Belgium, France, Germany, Japan, Mexico, the Netherlands, and the UK, our Sydney-based hub manages clients across Australia and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our flagship product, Miles, has completed over 60 successful implementations and earned a solid reputation in automotive finance, leasing, fleet, and mobility management. It&#39;s an ERP system renowned for its unmatched flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sofico operates at the intersection of rapidly transforming industries: automotive, finance, leasing, and IT. This convergence sparks innovation as our clients pioneer new product offerings, focusing on mobility solutions enabled by connected cars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us—a multinational company with over 600 staff—as we lead the way in industry innovation. Unlock new possibilities with Sofico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What We Offer&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, we welcome you to an international and multicultural company that has been thriving for over 30 years and is doubling in size every five years. Growth is in our DNA, and we strongly uphold our horizontal and open company culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take control of your career with a focus on personal development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an extensive six-month onboarding program, supported by a dedicated job coach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy continuous opportunities for learning and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a modern, state-of-the-art office that&#39;s easily accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onsite parking and walking distance from metro.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from a competitive salary, flexible office hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid option to work from home two days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access novated leasing options and mobile phone reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy complimentary coffee, soft drinks, breakfast and fruit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in team events, including afterwork drinks, BBQs, family days, and company weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to join a dynamic team and take your career to the next level, apply today!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;Product Manager (Data)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London, Bristol or Paris (Hybrid - 3 days in office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Data Products&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Product&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Paris and requires existing right to work in the UK or France.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Product Manager for Data Product Implementation, your primary responsibility is to successfully lead the data products rollout for a key Kaluza client. You will work closely with engineers and experts in the Kaluza Data Product team, other Kaluza domain Implementation leads, and relevant client subject-matter experts to ensure that our data model and products are localised to meet our client&#39;s needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate Kaluza data products and data models to our key clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Document and translate client requirements for data products and align them with the global product roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Development Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support development by refining and prioritising backlog items and work with software engineers to deliver solutions that drive value for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive product adoption through the creation of technical documentation, release communications, and delivering training sessions for client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Gain a broad understanding of various Kaluza Product areas—Billing &amp;amp; Payments, Customer Care, Energy Commerce and Energy Optimisation—and how data products can unlock value in each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Model Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; Be a key contributor to Kaluza&#39;s global data model with the potential to own its extension and maintenance for all clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the team to build and measure the right metrics for product success and nurture a culture of learning from data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Radiate information, improve transparency and communicate effectively to internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years experience as an agile Product Manager working on data platforms/products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rollout Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience supporting large-scale enterprise product rollouts, especially on &quot;edge&quot; / localised deployments of a global product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at managing stakeholders, with the ability to value and juggle competing priorities and influence decisions at all levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at written and visual communication to both technical and commercial audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a patient and tenacious problem solver who is willing to roll up their sleeves to learn and understand a domain despite limited knowledge or experience in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Nature:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a team player who embraces collaboration and knowledge sharing within your team and across different teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong preference for a &lt;strong&gt;French speaker&lt;/strong&gt; to support our implementations with key global clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable working in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where fast iteration and experimentation are the norm.&lt;/li&gt;
